Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnYusei Magic}ﾐｻﾞｴﾙ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.95,0:19:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnYusei Magic}(ﾐｻﾞｴﾙ)おもしろい｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.69,0:19:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnYusei Magic}ついに決着をつけるときが来たようだな ｶｲﾄ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于到了做个了断的时候了 海马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnYusei Magic}(遊馬)ｶｲﾄ…｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)海马……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.21,0:19:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnYusei Magic}なんだいったい!?\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.99,0:19:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnYusei Magic}(ｱｽﾄﾗﾙ)これは！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.72,0:19:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnYusei Magic}(小鳥)危ない！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)危险！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnYusei Magic}(ｵｰﾋﾞﾀﾙ７)\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(方舟７)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.30,0:19:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnYusei Magic}ｷﾞｮｴｰ ｽｸﾗｯﾌﾟは嫌であります｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔呃—— 我可不想被废弃掉啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnYusei Magic}(ﾐｻﾞｴﾙ)今日のところは退く｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)今天就先撤退。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnYusei Magic}だが 次は必ず…｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但下次一定会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.15,0:19:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnYusei Magic}(ｶｲﾄ)ﾐｻﾞｴﾙ…｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)米扎艾尔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.14,0:19:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnYusei Magic}(遊馬)うわっ… なんだこりゃ!?\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)哇…… 这什么情况！？
